Package: mcVarReduce
Type: Package
Title: Variance Reduction for Monte Carlo Integration
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Shaswat Bhushan", "Jangam", email = "sjangam2@student.gsu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Prakash", "Karki", email = "pkarki1@student.gsu.edu", role = "aut"),
    person("Mangsa Limbu", "Pheudin", email = "mlinbupheudin1@student.gsu.edu", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Implements control variates, antithetic variables, and importance
    sampling for a common Monte Carlo integration problem. The control-variate
    implementation is the main method, and a controlled correlation study is
    provided so that the effect of control quality on estimator precision can
    be investigated reproducibly. Accuracy is evaluated against the exact
    target value, and the three variance-reduction methods can be
    compared under the same target-function evaluation budget.
